  "@type": "skos:ConceptScheme",
  "$comment": "Community Specification License 1.0 (LL-002). Changed only through the RFC process (GOVERNANCE.md); a change is a new version. Every term is a draft. external_refs holds bSDD IFC 4.3 class URIs retrieved on 2026-11-04 (#33); [\"none\"] records that checking found no class and [] that the term is not yet checked. iso_20887_principles lists the ISO 20887:2020 principles a joint type serves, each with its clause number and name taken from the contents page in the free preview of the standard (#60); which principles a joint type serves is LoopLedger's judgment, not a claim made by the standard, and [] means the joint type serves none.",
